1
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,400
Yu-Gi-Oh!

2
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:09,177
Yummoo !

3
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,477
Yu

4
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:16,780
-Hi Yφο!

5
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:07,320
The card I hold in my hand
is the key to my victory.

6
00:01:07,660 --> 00:01:11,836
As soon as I play it, your world will
crumble as you sink to your doom.

7
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:15,629
Not if I can set Joey free from
your control first, Merrick.

8
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:18,280
Set Joey free?

9
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:21,940
Not as long as I hold the
Millennium Rod in my hand.

10
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:24,020
Now listen to me.

11
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:26,657
Play that card and destroy little Yugi.

12
00:01:26,740 --> 00:01:32,940
Wipe out the rest of his life points and
win me the power I deserve and do it now

13
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:36,660
The moment I've been waiting
for is about to arrive.

14
00:01:37,020 --> 00:01:38,420
It's all over Yugi.

15
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:41,896
No There's got to be a way
to put a stop to this duel.

16
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,059
They'll hurt Taya.

17
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,080
What do we do?

18
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:49,212
Seto, isn't there some way we can stop
this without putting Taya in danger?

19
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:51,820
Come on you guys time is almost up.

20
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:53,924
You have to stop this duel now.

21
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:57,400
Forget about me Just save Yugi and Joey!

22
00:01:58,260 --> 00:02:02,084
If you don't do something soon,
they'll both be in major trouble!

23
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:04,340
Please, just do it! I'll be fine!

24
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:06,031
I wouldn't listen to her!

25
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:07,580
We can't, Taya!

26
00:02:07,740 --> 00:02:09,093
He'll push that button!

27
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:10,360
Come on, Seto!

28
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:12,088
We can't let Taya get hurt!

29
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,460
She saved my life!

30
00:02:13,780 --> 00:02:16,500
There may be a way to
stop these rare hunters!

31
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:19,100
It's me! Now listen up!

32
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,240
Come on, Joey!

33
00:02:21,580 --> 00:02:23,397
This is your last chance to break free!

34
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:29,160
Ignore that fool, my servant, and use your
meteor of destruction to finish him off.

35
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,260
As soon as you play that card,

36
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:36,000
little Yugi will receive 1,000 points
worth of damage, destroying him.

37
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:38,807
And his most prized
possessions will be mine.

38
00:02:38,980 --> 00:02:41,457
He certainly won't need
them where he's going.

39
00:02:41,540 --> 00:02:45,128
Now do as I command and deliver
the final strike against him.

40
00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:46,260
This is it, Joey.

41
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:48,656
You have to remember who you are now.

42
00:02:48,860 --> 00:02:50,400
I am Joey.

43
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,620
It's faint, but I also
remember my friends.

44
00:02:58,980 --> 00:03:04,660
I remember going to Duelist Kingdom and
dueling my hardest to get to the top.

45
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:08,377
And I'm going to keep
using the magic of Elegant

46
00:03:08,460 --> 00:03:12,340
Egotist to double my harpies
again and again each turn.

47
00:03:12,700 --> 00:03:14,440
Go, Thousand Dragon!

48
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:20,680
Attack with Inferno Flame Brack!

49
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:27,780
And now, time to meet Red-Eyes!

50
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:30,380
A dragon like none you've ever seen!

51
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:35,040
Alright, time warp, go!

52
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:38,300
Oh no!

53
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:40,780
My dragon's been fossilized!

54
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:45,980
Not only did I win you star chips, but
I won you red eyes too, fair and square!

55
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:51,797
Alright, bozo brothers, try this on
for size, the Red-Eyes Black Dragon!

56
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:55,340
And now, with the magic
of my polymerization card,

57
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:59,400
I'll combine Joey's red
eyes with my Southern Skull!

58
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:03,000
Black Skull Dragon!

59
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:05,320
Molten Fireball Attack!

60
00:04:10,140 --> 00:04:11,420
That's right, Joey.

61
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,974
Fall to the dirt like a whimpering dog.

62
00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:15,720
Just face it, Joey.

63
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:19,477
You're a loser and a third-rate
duelist who belongs on his knees.

64
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:23,040
You can't do a thing without
your pal Yugi helping you.

65
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:25,060
Get up off the floor, Joey.

66
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:29,431
How do you expect to win the
finals acting like a big baby?

67
00:04:29,860 --> 00:04:32,220
Hey, chill out. The pommelin'

68
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:36,377
will commence as soon as I'm good and
ready, so don't get your briefs in a bunch.

69
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:37,754
You got that, blondie?

70
00:04:38,300 --> 00:04:39,130
Go!

71
00:04:39,213 --> 00:04:40,400
Flash, flare, blast!

72
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:47,640
The winner of this duel will
win three million dollars.

73
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:48,937
Attack me!

74
00:04:49,020 --> 00:04:54,257
you'll win you keep it your
sister needs that money you please

75
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:56,037
use this money for Serenity's

76
00:04:56,120 --> 00:05:01,937
operation thanks Yu-Gi well

77
00:05:02,020 --> 00:05:08,557
you win so take my locator card
you're finished weevil yeah

78
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:13,540
there goes my best problem What
have you done to my queen?!

79
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:17,600
You all right, Mako?

80
00:05:19,340 --> 00:05:21,037
Yes, that was an excellent duel.

81
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,061
Congratulations.

82
00:05:22,620 --> 00:05:23,517
Don't you worry.

83
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,220
I'll treat your cards well.

84
00:05:26,100 --> 00:05:26,960
You'd better.

85
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:29,780
And best of luck in the finals. Thanks.

86
00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:31,293
You're all right, Mako.

87
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:35,737
You know, when you think about it, Yuke,
both of our hearts are in our decks.

88
00:05:35,820 --> 00:05:36,680
We're a team.

89
00:05:37,100 --> 00:05:39,457
Together, we won't let
any duelist beat us.

90
00:05:39,540 --> 00:05:44,977
It's true We'll whoop this Maric creep and
his rare hunter goon squad so hard They

91
00:05:45,060 --> 00:05:49,577
won't know what hit him They'll be sorry
that they ever decided to mess with us

92
00:05:49,660 --> 00:05:50,820
My past,

93
00:05:50,980 --> 00:05:56,857
it's real You have no past
Now destroy him Destroy Yugi

94
00:05:56,940 --> 00:06:01,300
Get out of my head Your feeble
brain is no match for me

95
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:07,277
So, play Meteor of Destruction
now You belong to me, understand?

96
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:10,340
And I command you to vanquish Yu-Gi!

97
00:06:10,460 --> 00:06:11,340
I can't!

98
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,700
He's my best friend!

99
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,780
I won't destroy Yu-Gi!

100
00:06:17,420 --> 00:06:19,180
Yu-Gi's my pal!

101
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:20,601
Fight him, Joey!

102
00:06:21,140 --> 00:06:21,970
Silence!

103
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:25,340
Obey me at once or face
severe consequences!

104
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:26,836
You can do it, Joey!

105
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:28,000
I know you can!

106
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,200
Be strong!

107
00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:30,960
Gotta be strong!

108
00:06:31,980 --> 00:06:34,200
Joey's gonna do it! I know he is!

109
00:06:34,380 --> 00:06:36,877
Our friendship is strong
and so is his will!

110
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:39,537
Merrick's Millennium
Rod's got nothing on that.

111
00:06:39,620 --> 00:06:41,857
He's just got to keep fighting and break

112
00:06:41,940 --> 00:06:44,097
free before that anchor
falls into the ocean,

113
00:06:44,180 --> 00:06:45,157
taking us with it.

114
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,070
Come on, Joey.

115
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,337
Time is running out.

116
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:51,361
We can beat Merrick in his own
twisted game as soon as you wake up.

117
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:52,630
Merrick!

118
00:06:52,713 --> 00:06:53,960
You hide like a coward.

119
00:06:54,140 --> 00:06:58,669
But wherever you are, I know you can
hear me, and I've got some news for you.

120
00:06:58,940 --> 00:07:02,317
There will be a loser in this duel,
but it's not who you're thinking.

121
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:05,400
It's not me, and it's not Joey either.

122
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:07,559
It's you, Merrick!

123
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:10,560
You will lose this duel! What?

124
00:07:11,420 --> 00:07:15,417
You may have thought you could force Joey
to destroy me by taking over his mind,

125
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:17,037
but it looks like there's
something you didn't

126
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:19,457
take into account when you made your plan.

127
00:07:19,540 --> 00:07:22,240
The strength of Joey's
bond with his friends!

128
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:27,860
Time may be running out, but Joey's back,
and we're in control of this duel now.

129
00:07:28,340 --> 00:07:34,217
Your power over Joey has been removed,
and I'd say that means you lose, Youg!

130
00:07:34,300 --> 00:07:37,860
That timer may run out,
but since Joey is free,

131
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:40,837
you can't be considered
the winner of this duel.

132
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:41,750
Get it?

133
00:07:41,833 --> 00:07:46,120
Since you're not dueling anymore,
how can you possibly win this duel?

134
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,510
Ah!

135
00:07:48,593 --> 00:07:49,600
You'll pay for this!

136
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,722
What does Yugi think he's doing?

137
00:07:52,060 --> 00:07:54,020
That fool! Yugi!

138
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:55,900
Time is running out!

139
00:07:56,460 --> 00:07:58,740
Come on, guys. End this.

140
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:00,857
What are you gonna do now, Merrick?

141
00:08:00,940 --> 00:08:04,217
Just wait in your little
hideaway till you lose this duel?

142
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:08,960
This is your last chance for
victory, so come and get me!

143
00:08:09,340 --> 00:08:12,360
Joey can't be controlled,
so it's up to you!

144
00:08:12,540 --> 00:08:14,300
Everyone can be controlled,

145
00:08:14,540 --> 00:08:18,700
and once I force Joey to play
Meteor of Destruction, you're done!

146
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,800
I can't! Silence!

147
00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:23,400
No one can resist my Millennium Rod!

148
00:08:23,620 --> 00:08:26,520
Behold the full potential
of its ancient powers!

149
00:08:26,960 --> 00:08:28,820
Joey Wheeler no longer exists!

150
00:08:32,220 --> 00:08:33,560
It's over, Yuki.

151
00:08:34,300 --> 00:08:37,500
I activate Meteor of Destruction!

152
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:44,840
You dare to disrespect my power?

153
00:08:45,100 --> 00:08:48,041
Looks like your friend is
weaker than you thought!

154
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,900
Who's losing now?

155
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,360
You geese!

156
00:08:57,880 --> 00:08:59,760
Help me, please!

157
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,440
You did it!

158
00:09:03,980 --> 00:09:05,100
What? No!

159
00:09:05,540 --> 00:09:06,600
Yugi was right!

160
00:09:06,820 --> 00:09:09,640
Wheeler's will was too
powerful to overcome!

161
00:09:10,180 --> 00:09:11,010
No!

162
00:09:14,820 --> 00:09:15,650
Yugi!

163
00:09:15,900 --> 00:09:18,477
I knew Joey's heart was
too strong for Merrick.

164
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:20,560
There's only one thing left to do.

165
00:09:20,820 --> 00:09:22,700
Trap card, activate!

166
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:26,200
Mystical ref panel will
stop Merrick's meteor.

167
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:34,068
My trap card has absorbed the effects
of Merrick's Meteor of Destruction card.

168
00:09:34,340 --> 00:09:38,960
Now my Mystical Ref Panel can redirect
the Meteor's attack wherever I want.

169
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,240
What's he doing?

170
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:43,052
I'm not going to put you in danger, Joey.

171
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:44,910
Yugi.

172
00:09:47,020 --> 00:09:49,491
Yugi has quite a predicament on his hands.

173
00:09:49,740 --> 00:09:53,957
Thanks to Mystical Ref Panel, he has the
power to control the outcome of this duel,

174
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:56,117
leaving him with a difficult decision.

175
00:09:56,200 --> 00:10:01,880
He can either direct the attack towards
Wheeler or choose to destroy himself.

176
00:10:02,460 --> 00:10:06,240
And if either of them try to
escape, then Tay is done for.

177
00:10:06,740 --> 00:10:11,100
Unless my plan works soon,
but time is running out.

178
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,840
Why am I wearing your Millennium Puzzle?

179
00:10:16,220 --> 00:10:18,200
Because I gave it to you, Joey,

180
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:21,800
when I was trying to help
you remember our friendship.

181
00:10:22,060 --> 00:10:22,920
I'm confused.

182
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:25,537
Merrick tried to turn you against me,

183
00:10:25,620 --> 00:10:28,617
but our friendship ended up
being stronger than his powers.

184
00:10:28,700 --> 00:10:31,497
And giving you my puzzle
helped you to break free.

185
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:35,462
You're my best friend, Joey, and
no evil magic can take that away.

186
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:38,151
And now I have to put an end to this duel.

187
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:41,460
But remember, we defeated
Merrick together, Joey.

188
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:46,500
You guys better do something
soon, or... Or what?

189
00:10:47,020 --> 00:10:48,580
Or you're both in trouble.

190
00:10:49,780 --> 00:10:51,200
It's too late now.

191
00:10:51,860 --> 00:10:52,690
Huh?

192
00:10:56,900 --> 00:10:58,740
It's one of Kaiba's choppers.

193
00:10:58,980 --> 00:11:01,660
But who's flying that thing? No one.

194
00:11:01,820 --> 00:11:02,996
It's remote control.

195
00:11:05,820 --> 00:11:07,173
Where'd that come from?

196
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:09,940
I warned you, time to drop the crate.

197
00:11:10,380 --> 00:11:12,700
Not if I stop you first, Rare Hunter.

198
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:16,000
Say hello to my blue-eyes
white dragon card.

199
00:11:16,420 --> 00:11:17,340
Take this.

200
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,200
Big mistake.

201
00:11:23,220 --> 00:11:24,260
Not really!

202
00:11:28,420 --> 00:11:30,185
Chopper's taking out the trap!

203
00:11:30,700 --> 00:11:31,530
Taya's safe!

204
00:11:37,260 --> 00:11:38,090
Taya!

205
00:11:39,940 --> 00:11:41,920
Hey, guys! I'll get you out!

206
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:46,260
Thanks a lot, Mokuba!

207
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:48,217
I guess we're even now, Taya!

208
00:11:48,300 --> 00:11:49,771
Let's help Yugi and Joey!

209
00:11:49,900 --> 00:11:50,730
Right!

210
00:11:51,040 --> 00:11:52,300
We're coming, guys!

211
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,760
There's not much time left.

212
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:58,198
If one of us doesn't win,
we'll both be pulled under.

213
00:11:58,340 --> 00:12:01,457
And there's no way I'm going
to let that happen, Joey.

214
00:12:01,540 --> 00:12:03,220
What are you saying, Yook?

215
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:06,220
I'm saying that I've
decided to save you, Joey.

216
00:12:06,740 --> 00:12:09,197
There's no point in both of us going down.

217
00:12:09,280 --> 00:12:11,120
And if I lose, you're safe.

218
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:15,540
But I can't let you do this, Yook.

219
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,600
It's my decision.

220
00:12:18,780 --> 00:12:20,620
So now... No, Yooki!

221
00:12:20,940 --> 00:12:22,097
Take care of my puzzle.

222
00:12:22,180 --> 00:12:23,640
Now it's time.

223
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:26,353
Ref panel, direct your attack toward me.

224
00:12:29,940 --> 00:12:30,770
Yugi!

225
00:12:32,100 --> 00:12:32,930
Yugi!

226
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:45,220
The key.

227
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:47,197
But I can't just save myself.

228
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:48,633
I gotta help Yugi, too.

229
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:55,900
Joey, free yourself now.

230
00:12:56,260 --> 00:12:59,080
You've only got 30 seconds to make it out.

231
00:12:59,580 --> 00:13:01,260
Then the anchor falls.

232
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:03,840
You have to unlock your chains now.

233
00:13:06,020 --> 00:13:06,850
Come on, Joey.

234
00:13:06,933 --> 00:13:10,080
Hurry, before the anchor
falls and pulls you under.

235
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:12,140
Forget it.

236
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:15,417
No way am I letting my best
friend become shark bait.

237
00:13:15,500 --> 00:13:19,437
We're in this together, you, and there's
no way I'm letting you take the fall.

238
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:21,237
We're gonna make it out of this.

239
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:23,100
Oh, don't give up, Yugi.

240
00:13:23,340 --> 00:13:24,900
I'll think of something!

241
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,200
That's it.

242
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:29,972
Meteor of Destruction has another effect.

243
00:13:30,140 --> 00:13:34,081
Since Yugi has a monster on the
field, I can force it to attack me.

244
00:13:34,340 --> 00:13:35,980
This duel isn't over yet.

245
00:13:36,620 --> 00:13:38,580
Red-Eyes Black Dragon, attack!

246
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:42,680
Wipe out my life points so
Yugi's key will be revealed!

247
00:13:52,180 --> 00:13:53,920
Good old red-eyes.

248
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:57,960
Yugi, you've saved my butt
more times than I can count.

249
00:13:58,460 --> 00:14:01,740
This time, Joey's gonna be
the one doing the rescuing.

250
00:14:02,540 --> 00:14:05,420
You taught me about courage
and never giving up.

251
00:14:16,140 --> 00:14:17,360
I can see.

252
00:14:19,100 --> 00:14:20,800
Hang in there, Youg.

253
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:23,732
You'll be out of those chains in no time.

254
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:30,520
It's Joey.

255
00:14:32,780 --> 00:14:33,797
Almost there.

256
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:35,120
Gotta beat the clock.

257
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:37,560
Got it!

258
00:14:42,980 --> 00:14:45,900
That anchor's going to
drag both of them down.

259
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:48,190
Joey!

260
00:14:48,780 --> 00:14:49,610
Tristan!

261
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:57,620
No! No! Yugi! Joey!

262
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:04,280
Yugi, I'll save you.

263
00:15:08,680 --> 00:15:10,739
I told you I wouldn't let you down.

264
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:15,267
You're the best friend
a guy could ever have.

265
00:15:16,140 --> 00:15:17,060
Thanks, Yuki.

266
00:15:19,460 --> 00:15:20,290
Yuki!

267
00:15:20,373 --> 00:15:21,203
Hold on!

268
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:28,020
Gotcha, let's go! Where's Joey? His key!

269
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:30,202
Joey never took it from the box!

270
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:32,184
Hurry up and go get me his key!

271
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:33,520
I'll dive down!

272
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:38,190
Serenity!

273
00:15:38,500 --> 00:15:39,760
She's got the key!

274
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,740
Oh, man, this key won't work.

275
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:47,195
I need the other one.

276
00:15:50,340 --> 00:15:51,170
Huh?

277
00:15:51,253 --> 00:15:52,083
What's that?

278
00:15:52,620 --> 00:15:55,149
Is it Yugi coming back
down here to get me?

279
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:58,550
Serenity?

280
00:16:03,560 --> 00:16:04,640
She did it!

281
00:16:06,180 --> 00:16:07,260
You okay?

282
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,160
Serenity? But how?

283
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:13,906
Tristan and Mai brought me here
after we tracked you guys down.

284
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:18,660
Joey! Hey! Yugi! What's up? How cute.

285
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:20,817
The geeks are back together again.

286
00:16:20,900 --> 00:16:24,257
Now that I've set things straight
by saving Mokuba's little friend,

287
00:16:24,340 --> 00:16:28,580
I can get back to Battle City and
prepare for my victory in the finals.

288
00:16:36,640 --> 00:16:40,500
Yugi, I'm, uh, well, uh,
I'm sorry, man. It's okay.

289
00:16:40,860 --> 00:16:41,957
It's not your fault.

290
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:44,275
But I almost destroyed our friendship.

291
00:16:44,660 --> 00:16:48,980
Yeah, but in the end, not only did
you save our friendship, you saved me.

292
00:16:49,340 --> 00:16:50,760
I had no choice.

293
00:16:50,900 --> 00:16:53,217
Once I realized what I was doing to you,

294
00:16:53,300 --> 00:16:56,840
I had to make it right or
threw myself in trying, Yugi.

295
00:16:57,820 --> 00:17:01,497
Ever since we've been friends, we've
always kept an eye out for each other.

296
00:17:01,580 --> 00:17:04,933
I wasn't going to let some
rare hunter creep change that.

297
00:17:05,320 --> 00:17:06,197
Even if...

298
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:08,437
even if my brain was turned to mush.

299
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:09,980
It's okay

300
00:17:10,560 --> 00:17:13,097
But that Marek made a complete fool out of

301
00:17:13,180 --> 00:17:16,200
me How can I show my
face At the finals now

302
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:19,697
Will you get a grip please
You showed some real

303
00:17:19,780 --> 00:17:22,117
courage out there Joey So
who cares about how you

304
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:24,637
looked Just like the courage
you showed at Duelist

305
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:27,237
Kingdom When you dueled
for your sister Remember

306
00:17:27,320 --> 00:17:30,757
that What she did today
she did because of you

307
00:17:30,840 --> 00:17:34,977
You're her idol Ding dong
What kind of idol gets

308
00:17:35,060 --> 00:17:37,197
turned into a zombie
And then almost destroys

309
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:40,280
his best friend Talk about
setting a bad example.

310
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:42,362
Stop feeling sorry for yourself.

311
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:44,677
Your sister gets her strength from you.

312
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:48,054
That's why she waited till
now to take her bandages off.

313
00:17:48,740 --> 00:17:50,580
Serenity, you can see now.

314
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:55,500
I was afraid at first, but
hearing you save Yugi inspired me.

315
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:58,777
After I took my bandages
off and opened my eyes,

316
00:17:58,860 --> 00:18:01,625
you showed me what courage
was all about, Joey.

317
00:18:01,900 --> 00:18:03,560
I just had to dive in.

318
00:18:04,340 --> 00:18:05,170
Really?

319
00:18:05,253 --> 00:18:07,517
I made it through my
operation because of you.

320
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:09,660
You've always been there for me.

321
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:13,856
Today it was my turn to be
there for you, big brother.

322
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:19,640
Joey, I'd say we're a pretty good team.

323
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:22,800
I'm glad we're all together, guys.

324
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:24,960
You said it, Yugi.

325
00:18:26,940 --> 00:18:27,770
Hmm.

326
00:18:30,760 --> 00:18:33,740
Well, I'm sure glad that's over. Ditto.

327
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:40,500
Hey, Yugi, I believe this is
yours Thanks for everything, pal

328
00:18:41,300 --> 00:18:43,360
Thank you for saving my life,

329
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:46,357
Joey I gotta be the luckiest
guy in the world to have

330
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:49,017
friends like this Even when
things seemed hopeless,

331
00:18:49,100 --> 00:18:51,557
they never gave up on me
If it weren't for them,

332
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:52,934
who knows where I'd be

333
00:18:53,120 --> 00:18:57,280
Hey, Yugi, I'm glad that Millennium
Puzzle is back where it belongs

334
00:18:57,820 --> 00:18:59,000
That reminds me,

335
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:00,997
I owe a big thanks to you too,

336
00:19:01,080 --> 00:19:04,517
Yami You trusted me enough to
let me handle this on my own.

337
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:08,177
I could never have broken through
to Joey if you didn't believe in me.

338
00:19:08,260 --> 00:19:09,980
You and I make a great team,

339
00:19:10,100 --> 00:19:14,017
but it's also nice to know that I have
the strength to hold my own if I have to.

340
00:19:14,100 --> 00:19:17,100
And you helped me find that
strength inside myself.

341
00:19:17,260 --> 00:19:18,378
Hey, anyone hungry?

342
00:19:18,580 --> 00:19:19,500
I'm starving.

343
00:19:19,660 --> 00:19:21,189
Come on, let's go, Mokuba.

344
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,840
Hey, Kaiba! Hmm?

345
00:19:25,620 --> 00:19:28,697
We couldn't have gotten out
of that mess without you.

346
00:19:28,780 --> 00:19:31,320
I did what I had to, Yugi. Got it.

347
00:19:31,500 --> 00:19:32,460
Well, thank you.

348
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:35,900
I'll see you at the Battle City Finals.

349
00:19:36,280 --> 00:19:38,162
Guess that means you're welcome.

350
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:41,784
In all this insanity, I
forgot about the finals.

351
00:19:41,900 --> 00:19:44,017
That could be where
Merrick will strike next.

352
00:19:44,100 --> 00:19:49,041
This fight is far from over, and whenever
Merrick comes back, I'll be ready for him.
